WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Lao Lin, I really look down on you

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,730
Okay, I'll see how you handle it today

3
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:13,110
Divorce without telling you

4
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:14,110
It's my fault

5
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:15,110
But I am also afraid that you will worry

6
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:17,110
You have had enough to worry about since you were little.

7
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:19,110
I don't want to make you feel uncomfortable with this kind of thing again

8
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:21,110
You can punish me no matter what you want today

9
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:22,110
Just let me keep kneeling

10
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:23,110
As long as you can give up

11
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:26,100
Then just keep kneeling here

12
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:38,220
Lao Lin is also true

13
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:41,110
I don’t even know how to get you chopsticks when you’re eating.

14
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:42,110
Stop doing this
